WEBVTT

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.976
And I ended the study the next day.

00:20:01.539 --> 00:20:03.649
The good news
is I married her the next year.

00:20:03.673 --> 00:20:05.976
(Laughter)

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:13.000
(Applause)

00:20:13.445 --> 00:20:15.456
I just came to my senses, obviously.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.149
So situations have the power
to do [three things].

00:20:18.173 --> 00:20:20.954
But the point is,
this is the same situation

00:20:20.978 --> 00:20:24.444
that can inflame the hostile
imagination in some of us,

00:20:24.468 --> 00:20:26.205
that makes us perpetrators of evil,

00:20:26.229 --> 00:20:28.422
can inspire the heroic
imagination in others.

00:20:28.446 --> 00:20:31.560
It's the same situation
and you're on one side or the other.